217140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123342#issuecomment-5605217140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123342","id":5605217140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABThjTdA","user":{"login":"salwa-gitt","id":229059879,"node_id":"U_kgDODactJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229059879?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt","html_url":"https://github.com/salwa-gitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salwa-gitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:26:33Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:27:22Z","body":"> To be clear, you wrote the code? The AI tools just helped you with the process? You understand the solution? See our [contribution guidelines](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#ai-assisted-contributions)\r\n\r\nTo clarify: I do understand how the fix works! \r\n\r\nThe issue was that Project Settings stores resource paths as UIDs (`uid://...`), while the FileSystem dock uses standard paths (`res://...`). Comparing raw strings failed because the formats didn't match. Using `ResourceUID::ensure_path()` translates the UID back into a standard `res://` path so the comparison succeeds.\r\n\r\nI used AI to help me navigate the codebase and trace where the path comparison was happening, also not gonna lie the code was not written by me the LLM help me with that but I tested the build locally and verified the UI fix in the editor. I'm happy to address any feedback or changes needed!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5605217140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5605245464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123342#issuecomment-5605245464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123342","id":5605245464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABThlCGA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:28:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:30:03Z","body":"Please see the guidelines, I'd say this is invalid as it is not human authored while being non menial or trivial, and that should 